B A R
WELCOME TO TELEGRAPHENAMT
Where messages once moved through cables and code,
we focus on what happens face to face.
Conversation. Precision. Time well spent.
Inside the historic Telegraphenamt, classic bar culture is stripped down
and rebuilt with a contemporary attitude.
No theatrics, no shortcuts.
Our cocktail program is led by Bar Manager Igor, whose approach is
defined by balance, restraint and product-driven decisions.
Berlin at its core, informed by global influences, executed with discipline
rather than excess.
Every drink has a purpose.
Every detail is intentional.
