Drinks
Let's drink some jazz!
We offer you an extensive selection of Whisky, Rum, Gin and other liquors. And a staff that is fastidious about finding new offerings. But our speciality, along with different varieties of delicious Highballs, are self-prepared, bottle-aged cocktails! All ingredients have been married together in a glass bowl for a smoother experience.
We hope you appreciate and enjoy the creativity we have strived to achieve with our menu!
